Implemented REL-RC-K. No commit made.

**Summary**
- Added render-time pairing in [view.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disclaude/packages/core/src/disco/core/view.py:414): paired `ActionEvent`/`ObservationEvent` or `AgentErrorEvent` now render atomically, so condensation summaries or injected reminders cannot split assistant tool calls from tool results.
- Added `repair_tool_call_adjacency` in [view.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disclaude/packages/core/src/disco/core/view.py:59) to drop dangling assistant/tool fragments for retry payloads.
- Added one-shot driver retry for MiniMax/OpenAI-compatible protocol errors in [driver.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disclaude/packages/core/src/disco/core/loop/driver.py:100) and [driver.py](/var/home/dylan/projects/disclaude/packages/core/src/disco/core/loop/driver.py:699). It logs loudly and retries once with repaired history.
- Added regression tests for condensation boundary splits, injected reminders, and bounded protocol repair retry.

